{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Mes 12 vins rouges préférés pour quand j'ai besoin de... Détente"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1","s":"Allow me to help. What's another word for a taxi?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2","s":"THIS one comes from a very specific region in France."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4","s":"There's that one that starts with an \"N.\""},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio5"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio6"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_6_hint","n":"ClueAudio6","s":"Don't forget that long one that starts with an \"M.\""},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio7"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_7_hint","n":"ClueAudio7","s":"Of course there's the wine that everyone who doesn't drink wine says is their favorite. Does that help?"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio8"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio9"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio10"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio11"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_11_hint","n":"ClueAudio11","s":"What's that one that starts with a Z?"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio"}]}
